    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n99781" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνδῐώκω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>chase away together, join in the chase</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.135
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PEnteux.</u>
				70.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.17.13
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be constrained</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τῆς ἀνάγκης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
					43.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ πάθους τὸ συνδεδιωγμένον</span>
			<i>hurry, vehemence</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				21.1
			</span></i>; so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόνοι καὶ ῥυθμοὶ
			συνδεδ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mus.</u>
				p.22
			</span></i> K.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνδεδ. σφυγμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herod.Med.
				</span></i>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.Mus.</u>
				58.99
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόνοι συνδεδ. ὑπὸ τῆς πνιγὸς
					ἀμαυροῦνται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SA</u>
					1.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as law-term,
